msgstr "Afficher la valeur monétaire actuelle des points du client."

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:207
msgid "Display recent loyalty history."
msgstr "Afficher l’historique récent de fidélité."

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:208
msgid "Display a loyalty summary block."
msgstr "Afficher un résumé du programme de fidélité."

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:209
msgid ""
"Display the informational loyalty notice anywhere. Supports context=\"cart\" "
"or context=\"checkout\"."
msgstr ""
"Afficher la notice d’information de fidélité à l’emplacement souhaité. "
"Accepte context=\"cart\" ou context=\"checkout\"."

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:210
msgid ""
"Display the full loyalty redeem card anywhere. Supports context=\"cart\" or "
"context=\"checkout\"."
msgstr ""
"Afficher la carte complète d’utilisation des points à l’emplacement "
"souhaité. Accepte context=\"cart\" ou context=\"checkout\"."

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:214
msgid "Current display mode"
msgstr "Mode d’affichage actuel"

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:217
msgid "Quick reminder"
msgstr "Rappel"

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:217
msgid ""
"When the mode is set to Shortcode only, place both the loyalty card and the "
"informational notice with shortcodes where you want them to appear."
msgstr ""
"En mode Codes courts uniquement, insérez la carte de fidélité et la notice "
"d’information à l’aide de codes courts aux emplacements souhaités."

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:219
msgid "Recommended snippets"
msgstr "Exemples recommandés"

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:238
msgid "All advanced features are available in this free release."
msgstr ""
"Toutes les fonctions avancées sont disponibles dans cette version gratuite."

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:261
msgid "Advanced Rules"
msgstr "Règles avancées"

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:262
msgid ""
"Build category rules and exclusions with search-assisted selectors. Product-"
"level overrides are available directly inside the Product data panel."
msgstr ""
"Créez des règles par catégorie et des exclusions avec les sélecteurs de "
"recherche. Les taux propres aux produits se règlent dans leurs données "
"produit."

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:265
msgid "Exclude sale products from earning"
msgstr "Exclure les produits en promotion des gains de points"

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:269
msgid "Category earning rules"
msgstr "Règles de gain par catégorie"

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:281
msgid "Add category rule"
msgstr "Ajouter une règle de catégorie"

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:282
msgid ""
"Each rule defines how many points are earned for each 1 unit of store "
"currency spent in products from that category."
msgstr ""
"Chaque règle définit le nombre de points gagnés par unité monétaire dépensée "
"pour les produits de cette catégorie."

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:286
#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:423
msgid "Excluded products"
msgstr "Produits exclus"

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:297
msgid "Add excluded product"
msgstr "Ajouter un produit exclu"

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:298
msgid ""
"You can also type raw product IDs manually inside the selector field if "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez également saisir directement les identifiants de produits dans "
"le sélecteur."

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:302
#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:424
msgid "Excluded categories"
msgstr "Catégories exclues"

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:313
msgid "Add excluded category"
msgstr "Ajouter une catégorie exclue"

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:328
msgid "Extra Points Engine"
msgstr "Bonus de points"

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:329
msgid "Set optional one-time bonuses for customer lifecycle events."
msgstr ""
"Définissez des bonus uniques facultatifs pour les événements du parcours "
"client."

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:331
msgid "Registration bonus"
msgstr "Bonus d’inscription"

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:331
msgid "Awarded once when a new user account is created."
msgstr "Attribué une seule fois à la création d’un compte utilisateur."

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:332
msgid "First order bonus"
msgstr "Bonus de première commande"

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:332
msgid "Awarded once when the first eligible order is processed."
msgstr ""
"Attribué une seule fois au traitement de la première commande éligible."

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:333
msgid "Approved product review bonus"
msgstr "Bonus d’avis produit approuvé"

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:333
msgid "Awarded once per approved product review."
msgstr "Attribué une seule fois par avis produit approuvé."

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:345
msgid "Campaigns"
msgstr "Messages clients"

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:346
msgid ""
"Configure customer-facing messages that make loyalty earnings easier to "
"understand."
msgstr ""
"Configurez les messages qui expliquent aux clients leurs gains de fidélité."

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:348
msgid "Enable pending points notice"
msgstr "Activer la notice de points en attente"

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:348
msgid ""
"Display a custom message in My Account when a customer has an eligible order "
"that will earn points later."
msgstr ""
"Afficher un message personnalisé dans Mon compte lorsqu’une commande "
"éligible permettra de gagner des points ultérieurement."

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:349
msgid "Pending points notice text"
msgstr "Texte de la notice de points en attente"

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:349
msgid ""
"Available placeholders: {points}, {order_number}, {status}, {total}, "
"{currency}, {product_name}, {product_link}, {order_link}, {order_summary}."
msgstr ""
"Variables disponibles : {points}, {order_number}, {status}, {total}, "
"{currency}, {product_name}, {product_link}, {order_link}, {order_summary}."

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:350
msgid "Statuses considered pending"
msgstr "États considérés comme en attente"

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:351
msgid "Pending"
msgstr "En attente de paiement"

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:352
msgid "On hold"
msgstr "En attente"

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:353
#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-settings.php:103
msgid "Processing"
msgstr "En cours"

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:354
msgid ""
"Only the latest eligible order in one of these statuses will be used for the "
"pending message."
msgstr ""
"Seule la dernière commande éligible dans l’un de ces états sera utilisée "
"pour le message en attente."

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:357
msgid ""
"Order-linked references in My Account history are enabled automatically when "
"a history entry is tied to an order owned by the current customer."
msgstr ""
"Les liens vers les commandes s’affichent automatiquement dans l’historique "
"Mon compte lorsque l’entrée concerne une commande appartenant au client "
"connecté."

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:367
msgid "Levels & Badges"
msgstr "Niveaux et badges"

#: includes/admin/class-rewardly-loyalty-admin.php:368
